simulator lang=spectre
subckt rf_rebias4_v12 (rf clk vdd vss)
C0 (rf g0) capacitor c=1p
R0 (g0 a) resistor r=5k
X0 (g0 a vdd vss) pll_inv wn=8u wp=20.0u
C1 (a g1) capacitor c=1p
R1 (g1 b) resistor r=5k
X1 (g1 b vdd vss) pll_inv wn=2u wp=5.0u
C2 (b g2) capacitor c=1p
R2 (g2 c) resistor r=5k
X2 (g2 c vdd vss) pll_inv wn=4u wp=10.0u
C3 (c g3) capacitor c=1p
R3 (g3 d) resistor r=5k
X3 (g3 d vdd vss) pll_inv wn=8u wp=20.0u
X4 (d clk vdd vss) pll_inv wn=16u wp=40.0u
ends rf_rebias4_v12
